    <string name="sink_test_title">Test sink detection</string>
    <string name="sink_test_intro">When the alarm rings it only turns off once the camera sees a real sink: any bathroom or kitchen sink works, no photos needed. Try it here with the light on, standing at the sink with the basin in the middle of the picture. A sink seen from across the room or through a doorway doesn\'t count. It only starts looking once the phone has been picked up, and a sink shown on a phone or TV screen doesn\'t count.</string>
